/out + adjustable see-through level for your own view\n• Auto-visible timer (15 / 30 / 60 seconds)\n• Resize the button, lock its position, auto-dim, collapse it to a small orb\n• 5 color themes (including Rainbow) and a built-in \"?\" guide\n• Mobile friendly: joystick-safe dragging, no keyboard needed\n• Saves your settings (needs an executor with writefile; works without it too)\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Join a game, then execute the script\n2. Tap the button (or press G) to turn invisibility on/off\n3. Open the menu → \"?\" for a guide to every setting\n\nIMPORTANT\n • If it doesn't work, try V2 or V3.\n•Teated on: [Hide And Seek , Brookhaven and Some of other games too ]\n• Tested on: [Delta Excutor] too\n• The script only saves your settings to a local file (NOVAX_invisible.json).\n  No external requests, no webhooks, no personal data is collected.\n\nCHANGELOG\nv1.0 — release\n\nMade by NOVAX","tags":["roblox","robloxscripts","Invisible","InvisibleScript","UniversalScript"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68a207357fed70a08eba3dc9","username":"NOoVAX","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b2c6a315a260123d044fd7b9ca1af4446763d3290b128b0e529fa948f1583b26.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68a207357fed70a08eba3dc9-1758714270087.png"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"68a207357fed70a08eba3dc9","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b2c6a315a260123d044fd7b9ca1af4446763d3290b128b0e529fa948f1583b26.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68a207357fed70a08eba3dc9-1758714270087.png"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-11T09:01:03.654Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"working","pct":100,"conf":0.3,"n":{"w":3,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":3,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":1,"at":"2026-10-21T21:50:29.618Z","last":"www","win":14,"math